WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.665
"Someone's car was stolen!" Roxy flew down the alley.

2
00:00:07.666 --> 00:00:09.656
A man held a car key.

3
00:00:09.657 --> 00:00:11.617
He looked furious.

4
00:00:11.618 --> 00:00:14.492
"How will I get to work now?

5
00:00:14.493 --> 00:00:17.300
I paid a lot of money for that car!"

6
00:00:17.301 --> 00:00:19.848
Detective Smith ran over.

7
00:00:19.849 --> 00:00:22.459
"Who stole your car?" Roxy asked.

8
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.465
"Did you see the thief?"

9
00:00:24.466 --> 00:00:28.925
"No," the man said. "But I saw his truck!"

10
00:00:28.926 --> 00:00:31.099
Detective Smith took out his notepad.

11
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.087
"What does it look like?"

12
00:00:33.088 --> 00:00:36.211
"It's a garbage truck," the man said.

13
00:00:36.212 --> 00:00:39.895
"It says Trashman's Trash Pickup on the side."

14
00:00:39.896 --> 00:00:41.803
Roxy was confused.

15
00:00:41.804 --> 00:00:43.775
"The thief was in a garbage truck.

16
00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:46.542
So how did he steal your car?"

17
00:00:46.543 --> 00:00:50.365
"The truck has a big arm with a claw," the man said.

18
00:00:50.366 --> 00:00:52.970
He held out his arm to show how the claw worked.

19
00:00:52.971 --> 00:00:56.723
"The claw grabbed my car and put it in the back of the truck!"

20
00:00:56.724 --> 00:01:00.549
The man kicked a coffee cup lying on the sidewalk.

21
00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:02.876
"Trashman stinks at his job.

22
00:01:02.877 --> 00:01:07.113
He picked up my car, but he didn't pick up any of this trash!"

23
00:01:07.114 --> 00:01:10.104
"Hmm," Detective Smith said.

24
00:01:10.105 --> 00:01:14.300
"Maybe Trashman robbed Metro City Electronics too."

25
00:01:14.301 --> 00:01:18.264
Roxy nodded. "We should find out."

26
00:01:18.265 --> 00:01:22.232
Detective Smith looked up the address for Trashman's Trash Pickup.

27
00:01:22.233 --> 00:01:25.777
"The headquarters is just north of the city."

28
00:01:25.778 --> 00:01:32.959
"I'll go check it out, Detective!" Roxy flew off.

29
00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:36.734
Moments later Roxy landed in front of a huge building.

30
00:01:36.735 --> 00:01:40.845
She went inside and entered an enormous room.

31
00:01:40.846 --> 00:01:43.219
Piles of trash surrounded her.

32
00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:45.717
Roxy heard a sound.

33
00:01:45.718 --> 00:01:49.607
A man was carrying a box at the other end of the room.

34
00:01:49.608 --> 00:01:52.324
Some nice cars were parked near him.

35
00:01:52.325 --> 00:01:54.804
He wore a filthy, ripped jacket.

36
00:01:54.805 --> 00:01:58.603
His hair and beard stuck out in all different directions.

37
00:01:58.604 --> 00:02:01.974
"Trashman!" Roxy shouted.

38
00:02:01.975 --> 00:02:04.640
The man dropped the box he'd been carrying.

39
00:02:04.641 --> 00:02:08.886
"Rocket Girl! What are—ahugh! Ahugh!"

40
00:02:08.887 --> 00:02:13.002
The man coughed. "What are you doing here?"

41
00:02:13.003 --> 00:02:15.273
Roxy put her hands on her hips.

42
00:02:15.274 --> 00:02:20.254
"You've been stealing things instead of picking up trash."

43
00:02:20.255 --> 00:02:22.131
Trashman folded his arms.

44
00:02:22.132 --> 00:02:25.900
"So what? I'm tired of all this trash.

45
00:02:25.901 --> 00:02:29.391
I decided to steal some nice things!"

46
00:02:29.392 --> 00:02:31.371
Roxy narrowed her eyes.

47
00:02:31.372 --> 00:02:35.942
"You won't have any nice things where you're going—jail!"

48
00:02:35.943 --> 00:02:41.234
Trashman laughed and then coughed again.

49
00:02:41.235 --> 00:02:45.453
"No way! I'm putting you out with the trash!"

50
00:02:45.454 --> 00:02:48.292
He stepped over to the wall and pulled a lever.

51
00:02:48.293 --> 00:02:53.488
Clank! Doors opened above Roxy's head.

52
00:02:53.489 --> 00:02:55.655
Then . . . Shwoompf!

53
00:02:55.656 --> 00:02:59.147
Tons of trash crashed down on her.

54
00:02:59.148 --> 00:03:02.416
"Ha-ha! Ahugh! Ahugh!"

55
00:03:02.417 --> 00:03:04.494
Trashman ran out the door.

56
00:03:04.495 --> 00:03:11.438
"So long, Rocket Girl!"

